 e Weave?Starting in Stourbridge and going to all five (current) Weavers Rea
 l Ale House (Stourbridge\, Bewdley\, Kidderminster\, Worcester and Malvern)
 . Shortest route about 34 miles.Drink in each.Raising funds for Cardiac Ris
 k in the Young (CRY) in memory of Matthew Notley. Please try and raise or d
 onate at least £34 (pound a mile).Whether you want to go for the Fastest K
 nown Time or plan the shortest possible route or just have a grand social\,
  this proves to be a huge event.The Weavers team are backing us and will be
  giving a warm welcome at each checkpoint. Shorter versions available if yo
